-- examples/checks/whynot-unloaded.rofl — A RELATION A FILE LEFT OUT IS NOT A GAP.
--
-- The world carries an index of its units, as facts/model-units.rofl is the JS
-- model's: `wu_calls` is concluded by a file this world does not load, and
-- `wu_nowhere` by none. whynot names the one and says the other is a gap
-- (w_whynot_tells_absent_from_unloaded); whycheck asks both of each engine.

unit_concludes("rules/wu-calls.rofl", wu_calls).
unit_concludes("rules/wu-calls.rofl", wu_reaches).
wu_site(a).
wu_linked(X) :- wu_site(X), wu_calls(X, _).
wu_orphan(X) :- wu_site(X), wu_nowhere(X).
